  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPR&apos;G INCLUSSIVE DIALOGUE,RECONL&apos;N IN ETH. ASSO&apos;N OF INCLUSSIVE PEACE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Supporting Inclusive Dialogue and Reconciliation in Ethiopia (Phase 3) , implemented by Association for Inclusive Peace. The main objective of the project is to support inclusive, effective, and meaningful dialogue and reconciliation initiatives in Ethiopia, with a specific focus on the National Dialogue and on the implementation of the CoHA. This includes collaboration with civil society actors at both national and within the Tigray regions, where there have been challenges regarding inclusivity and transparency in the implementation process. Inclusive Peace aims to support efforts to improve openness in this area.</narrative>
  </description>
